[en.FOCUS_C12_INTRODUCE_RESEARCH_TEAM]
Introduce research team

[en.FOCUS_C12_INTRODUCE_RESEARCH_TEAM_desc]
The research capabilities in Las Pegasus are at the forefront of the world, with countless new inventions being created every day. However, the farm is gradually falling behind the trend. Now, our increasingly close relationship with Las Pegasus provides an opportunity for scientific collaboration. With Las Pegasus’s approval, we can bring in some research teams to quickly enhance our research capabilities.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_INTRODUCE_RESEARCH_TEAM]
引进科研团队

[zh.FOCUS_C12_INTRODUCE_RESEARCH_TEAM_desc]
洛马基的科研水平处于世界顶尖水平，每天都有无数的新发明被创造出来，而采石农场却在逐渐落后于潮流，如今我们与洛马基日益密切的来往为科研合作创造了契机，在洛马基的允许下，我们可以引进一些科研团队来迅速提升我们的科研水平。

